{
  "description": "事前審査の返答（review.json。書き手は事前審査の block の受け付け）{reason, faces: [穴], shrink: [別案], faces_none?, resolved?, stuck_recommend?}。対応表 design_map と出自の申告 origins は受け付けが外して往復の控え（pass.json）に置き、review.json には書かない。穴の行の型の住処は事前審査の役の output_format（受け付けが照らす）で、ここは読み手（修正の段・差分の審査・line）が読む欄の型だけを書く",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "reason": {"type": "string"},
    "faces": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "key": {"type": "string"},
          "unit_keys": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": ["integer", "string"]}},
          "kind": {"type": "string"},
          "where": {"type": "string"},
          "why": {"type": "string"},
          "severity": {"type": "string"},
          "reach": {"type": "string"},
          "no_add": {"type": "string"},
          "decided_by": {"type": "string"},
          "undecided_because": {"type": "string"},
          "fences": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
          "world": {"type": "string"},
          "recommend": {"type": "object", "properties": {"answer": {"type": "string"}, "note": {"type": "string"}, "why": {"type": "string"}}},
          "no_narrow": {"type": "string"}
        }
      }
    },
    "shrink": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "key": {"type": "string"},
          "unit_keys": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": ["integer", "string"]}},
          "alternative": {"type": "string"},
          "why": {"type": "string"}
        }
      }
    },
    "faces_none": {"type": "string"},
    "resolved": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}},
    "stuck_recommend": {"type": "object", "properties": {"answer": {"type": "string"}, "note": {"type": "string"}, "why": {"type": "string"}}}
  }
}
